                  "tooltip": [
                    {
                      "field": "CUSTOMER_NAME",
                      "title": "Account"
                    },
                    {
                      "field": "SEGMENT"
                    },
                    {
                      "field": "NET_REVENUE",
                      "type": "quantitative",
                      "format": "$,.0f",
                      "title": "Net revenue"
                    },
                    {
                      "field": "REVENUE_TARGET",
                      "type": "quantitative",
                      "format": "$,.0f",
                      "title": "Target"
                    },
                    {
                      "field": "ATTAINMENT",
                      "type": "quantitative",
                      "format": ".1%"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "datasources": [
            "ds-bubble"
          ],
          "scope": "detail"
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "ask",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### Ask Revenue Advisor\nOnce published to CoWork, use the chat box below this dashboard. Try:\n- *Why is EMEA Enterprise behind target in Q3 2026? Quantify the drivers.*\n- *Which accounts contributed most to the Q3 shortfall?*\n- *Will the renewal-delayed revenue recover in Q4?*\n- *How much of the gap is associated with discounts and refunds?*\n\nDrivers come from the `RECORDED_DRIVER` field logged by sales ops. They are recorded reasons, not inferred causes."
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "accounts",
